    "summary": "Restored world-sea-001's snapshot (509e888; every restored path is owned), then fixed findings 1-8. (1) sail-and-dock now samples real canvas pixels (15x15 tile interiors via data-camera) at a Palm Key land tile, a shoal-bar tile, Palm Key's west dock and a sea tile, and expects each tile's placeholder colour. The palette moved into the Phaser-free apps/web/src/palette.ts so the tests use the scene's own constants. (2) The same scenario waits until the ship is drawn at its start, records data-fog-revealed, finds the open-sea tiles near the route that are still fog-coloured on the minimap (the scene now reports its geometry in data-minimap), then requires the count to rise leg by leg and every one of those minimap pixels to turn to sea. (3) dockInReach requires hullPathIsClear along the straight run to the berth, checked one sub-unit at a time. A unit test covers a diagonal land-corner cut, a clear straight run and a shoal mid-segment. (4) protocol PLACEMENT_HEADING_COUNT replaces the hard-coded max(63); apps/server/src/testPlacement.test.ts ties it to content HEADING_COUNT, and the protocol tests use it. (5) seaValidation derives its octile costs from map.subUnitsPerTile with an integer square root (octileStepCosts). A unit test checks several scales and shows that half the scale gives exactly half the costs. (6) smoke-build imports TEST_PLACEMENT_PATH. (7) apps/server/package.json has a literal \u00a7 again. (8) HeadlessClient throws a clear error if room.connection.events.onmessage is missing, and a comment names @colyseus/sdk 0.18.4. docs/architecture.md's docking line now mentions the clear-run check. Checks run after npm ci: npm run typecheck (exit 0), test:unit (135 passed), test:integration (21 passed), npm run build including the smoke test (passed), and the full Playwright suite with the JSON reporter (4 passed); check-report reported that all 4 scenarios follow the verifier's rules. Mutation checks: with the tile layer not drawn, the land-tile assertion failed (share 0). With the minimap not painting revealed tiles, the fog assertion failed (94 candidates still fogged).",
